{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50643","headline":"和坂领客对月思乡之作 · 王孝廉","name":"和坂领客对月思乡之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寂朱明夜，团团白月轮。\n几山明影彻，万象水天新。\n弃妾看生怅，羁情对动神。\n谁云千里隔，能照两乡人。\n（同前。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王孝廉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}